+  <div class="guide-hero-icon">🔒</div>
+  <div>
+    <div class="guide-hero-eyebrow">Legal &amp; Privacy</div>
+    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
+    <p class="guide-hero-sub">This page explains, in plain language, what data this site collects, which outside services it uses, and how affiliate links work. Ready? China! is a small independent site — this isn't a corporate legal document, just an honest explanation of what happens when you visit.</p>
+    <div class="guide-meta"><span>📅 Updated August 2026</span></div>
+  </div>
